An investment lot uses a cost commodity other than the default valuation
commodity. Opposing postings balance the transaction without another warning.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock

2024-01-01 Foreign-cost round trip
  Assets:Stock  1 STOCK {10 USD}
  Assets:Stock  -1 STOCK {10 USD} @ 10 USD
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[FOREIGN_LOT_COST_CURRENCY] Assets:Stock: lot cost in USD must be expressed in the default commodity SEK. Unrealized gains omit affected positions; their totals may be incomplete
  <stdin>:11:3
  <stdin>:12:3
